      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good point. I filed a tracking issue for visibility: https://issues.gerritcodereview.com/issues/561838827\n\nThe affected audience is Bazel consumers of JGit, primarily in the Gerrit ecosystem. Official JGit builds are Maven-based.\n\nThe intended migration is:\n\n* use //org.eclipse.jgit:jgit for ordinary compile/test dependencies\n* use //org.eclipse.jgit:jgit-stamped when packaging an artifact that needs the Implementation-Version manifest entry\n\nGerrit and Gitiles have follow-up changes that use this split at their WAR packaging boundaries, so their WARs still contain the versioned JGit jar without pulling the stamped jar into regular build/test targets.",
